      "created_at": "2025-04-16T20:56:11Z",
      "updated_at": "2025-04-16T20:56:11Z",
      "body": "We need to have a chat about this functionallity. In theory it is expected behaviour as we can not know where you want the item placed for the other layouts and it could be possible that you want to have the structure different between multiple layouts. I think there might be a good solution with having one base layout and generating the layout of the other sizes automatically (with an algorithm that we already use when adding layouts) and maybe a second one that always moves the items you move to the same section (if there is enough space, which might not be the case for certain dynamic sections)\n\nWhat do you think @manuel-rw ?",
