      "updated_at": "2025-05-22T09:39:15Z",
      "body": "I came here to report this as a bug, not expecting it to be intended behaviour. \n\nI too use categories for different purposes. Like transport. I deliberately made the widget bigger in the transport section too, which is not only not staying larger on mobile, but it comes out of the category. This behaviour is very strange. \n\nAs you can see it doesn't even keep the order. On desktop, in the category it's Proxmox, Departures, Departures. On the mobile it's Departures, Departures, Proxmox.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/031d3256-d792-47f8-a037-f280146c6ea0)\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1272757b-0c7e-455d-a0db-2b1fa1a5a8f2)",
