      "body": "> This issue has been open for a really long time, so I think it's just not a common use case for other people. That said, you throw this into AI and I think it might be able to generate a CSS that will fix it.\n\nAlthough many people who use dashboards like this tend to be of the nerdy type, I also wonder how many get this issue and simply move on to something else, without coming here to Github. Maybe many people, many nobody. Either way the issue is disappointing and I've been using Flame happily for a while now - not as pretty, but adapts to any screen size perfectly, keeping things in order",
